                    <span id="lblSpecialRequirementText"><div><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt;">EXAMINATION INFORMATION</span></strong></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br /></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Please note that this position requires that you take an examination in order to be placed on an eligible list for Counselor. This examination is separate from the application process.<br /><br /></span></div><div><br /></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Examination Bulletin</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Please read the entire bulletin to obtain specific information about this examination. This information can be found at</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">https://www.cde.ca.gov/re/di/jb/counselorcsbf.asp<br /><br />For additional information or assistance, please contact the following Claudia McCammond at 510-936-5584 or cmccammond@gmail.com or Dr. Chemene Hooker-Henry at 510-936-5587 or chhenry@csb-cde.ca.gov </span></div></span>
